			<string name="help0" value="#e[How to participate in the Event]#n\n\nWhen a #b#eblue-colored#n#k announcement appears that the event is closed, click the #e[Pole]#n and select #e[Okay! Let's go.]#n to enter.\nYou can also click the [Pole] ahead of time and click on [Okay! Let's go.] as soon as the event announcement is made.\n\n \n\nMake sure you try to enter the event map only after the event announcement.\nThe event applicants are accepted in the order that they #eapply#n after the announcement.\n\nYou can only participate once per day.\nMake sure you have one empty Etc slot for the Participation Prize, or you cannot participate in the event.\nYou must discard your Scroll of Secrets to participate.\n\n#r  If you change channels or use the Cash Shop while on the event map, you will be disqualified from the event."/>
